[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5341.83, "timestamp": "01:29:01", "text": "德文郡其实并不，你知道，并不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5345.35, "timestamp": "01:29:05", "text": "真的，嗯，足够在意去拿东西吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5349.51, "timestamp": "01:29:09", "text": "这只是一个很好的实验。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5351.91, "timestamp": "01:29:11", "text": "好的，你打开水龙头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5354.149, "timestamp": "01:29:14", "text": "它像液体一样流出来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5356.709, "timestamp": "01:29:16", "text": "冒着黑色的气泡。它是黑色的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5358.149, "timestamp": "01:29:18", "text": "冒泡的液体，但你知道，在……之下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5360.55, "timestamp": "01:29:20", "text": "有一点点，就像一点点呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5363.189, "timestamp": "01:29:23", "text": "半透明蓝色液体。结果出来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5365.91, "timestamp": "01:29:25", "text": "那东西就是……呃，蓝色的液体，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5368.79, "timestamp": "01:29:28", "text": "它在气泡下面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5371.59, "timestamp": "01:29:31", "text": "然后当你……好吧，我希望你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5374.47, "timestamp": "01:29:34", "text": "掷一个 d20。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5376.629, "timestamp": "01:29:36", "text": "哦，该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5379.03, "timestamp": "01:29:39", "text": "萨拉公开或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5381.35, "timestamp": "01:29:41", "text": "公开地。公开地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5383.35, "timestamp": "01:29:43", "text": "我很害怕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5384.31, "timestamp": "01:29:44", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5385.99, "timestamp": "01:29:45", "text": "等待。和所有人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5388.87, "timestamp": "01:29:48", "text": "哦好的。也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5390.229, "timestamp": "01:29:50", "text": "好的。我就选第一个吧。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5393.189, "timestamp": "01:29:53", "text": "是五分。好的。好的。当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5397.189, "timestamp": "01:29:57", "text": "喝了之后，你会感觉身体很轻盈。"}, 